          %p
            for the corresponding
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/projection+operator"} projection operator
          %p By construction this is such that
          .maruku-equation
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
