            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Joseph+M.+Renes"}> Joseph M. Renes
                , 4.32 in:
                %em Quantum Information Theory
                (2015) &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://edu.itp.phys.ethz.ch/hs15/QIT/renes_lecture_notes14.pdf"}> pdf
                \&amp;rbrack; De Gruyter (2022) &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1515/9783110570250"}> doi:10.1515/9783110570250
                \&amp;rbrack;
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Sumeet+Khatri"}> Sumeet Khatri
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Mark+M.+Wilde"} Mark M. Wilde
                %em Principles of Quantum Communication Theory: A Modern Approach
                \&amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2011.04672"}> arXiv:2011.04672
                \&amp;rbrack;
          %p Further:
          %ul
            %li{:id => "BengtssonŻyczkowski06"}
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ingemar+Bengtsson"}> Ingemar Bengtsson
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Karol+%C5%BByczkowski"} Karol Życzkowski
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Geometry of Quantum States — An Introduction to Quantum Entanglement
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1017/CBO9780511535048"} doi:10.1017/CBO9780511535048
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://www.researchgate.net/publication/266435541_Geometry_of_Quantum_States_An_Introduction_to_Quantum_Entanglement"} ResearchGate
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Robert+B.+Griffiths"}> Robert B. Griffiths
                ,
                %em Quantum Channels, Kraus Operators, POVMs
                (2012) &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://quantum.phys.cmu.edu/QCQI/qitd412.pdf"}> pdf
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/Griffiths-QuantumChannels.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
            %li#AttalLectureNotes
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/St%C3%A9phane+Attal"}> Stéphane Attal
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Quantum Channels
                %em Lectures on Quantum Noises
                \&amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "http://math.univ-lyon1.fr/~attal/Quantum_Channels.pdf"}> pdf
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/Attal-QuantumChannels.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "http://math.univ-lyon1.fr/~attal/chapters.html"} webpage
          %p See also
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                Caleb J. O’Loan,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Topics in Estimation of Quantum Channels
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1001.3971"} arXiv:1001.397
            %li
              %p
                John A. Smolin, Frank Verstraete, Andreas Winter,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Entanglement of assistance and multipartite state distillation
                %strong 72
                (2005) 052317 (
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/quant-ph/0505038"}> arXiv:quant-ph/0505038
                )
            %li
              %p
                John Watrous,
                %em Mixing doubly stochastic quantum channels with the completely depolarizing channel
                (2008) (
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/0807.2668"}> arXiv
                )
            %li
              %p
                Wikipedia,
                %em
                  %a{:href => "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Quantum_operation"} Quantum Operation
          %p
            The description of completely positive maps in terms of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/dagger-categories"} dagger-categories
            (see at
            = succeed ")" do
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantum+information+theory+via+dagger-compact+categories"} quantum information theory via dagger-compact categories
          %ul
            %li#Selinger05
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Peter+Selinger"}> Peter Selinger
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Dagger-compact closed categories and completely positive maps
                %strong 170
                (2007) 139-163 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/j.entcs.2006.12.018"}> doi:10.1016/j.entcs.2006.12.018
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/SelingerPositiveMaps.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
            %li#Coecke07
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bob+Coecke"}> Bob Coecke
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Complete positivity without compactness
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://www.comlab.ox.ac.uk/files/666/RR-07-05.pdf"} pdf
          %p This is further explored in:
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bob+Coecke"}> Bob Coecke
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Eric+Paquette"} Eric Paquette
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dusko+Pavlovic"} Dusko Pavlovic
                %em Classical and quantum structures
                (2008) &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "http://www.comlab.ox.ac.uk/files/627/RR-08-02.pdf"}> pdf
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/Coecke-Paquette-Pavlovic-CQS.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
            %li#CoeckeHeunen11
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bob+Coecke"}> Bob Coecke
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Chris+Heunen"} Chris Heunen
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Pictures of complete positivity in arbitrary dimension
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1110.3055"} arXiv:1110.3055
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bob+Coecke"}> Bob Coecke
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Chris+Heunen"} Chris Heunen
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Aleks+Kissinger"} Aleks Kissinger
                %em Categories of Quantum and Classical Channels
                (
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1305.3821"}> arXiv:1305.3821
                )
          %p For the universal property, see
          %ul
            %li
              Mathieu Huot, Sam Staton,
              %em Universal properties in quantum theory
              (QPL 2018) (
              %a{:href => "https://www.mathstat.dal.ca/qpl2018/papers/QPL_2018_paper_68.pdf"}> pdf
              ).
          %p On quantum channel capacity:
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                Alexander S. Holevo,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Quantum Systems, Channels, Information – A Mathematical Introduction
                = succeed "," do
                  %strong 16
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1515/9783110273403"} doi:10.1515/9783110273403
            %li
              %p
                Alexander S. Holevo,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Quantum channel capacities
                %strong 50
                440 (2020) &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://iopscience.iop.org/article/10.1070/QEL17285/meta"}> doi:10.1070/QEL17285/meta
                \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            Axiomatization via
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/2-categories"} 2-categories
            of
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/von+Neumann+algebras"} von Neumann algebras
          %ul
            %li
              Robert Allen, Dominic Verdon:
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %mi ℂ
                        %msup
                          %mi P
                          %mn ∞
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbb{C}P^\infty
                  and beyond: 2-categorical dilation theory
              %strong 41
              50 (2024) 1783-1811 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2310.15776"}> arXiv:2310.15776
              ,
